  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the following compounds (Column-I) with their uses (Column-II)</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>S. No.</td>\t\t\t<td>Column-I</td>\t\t\t<td>S.No.</td>\t\t\t<td>Column-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ca</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>casts of statues</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>white wash</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>antacid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>washing soda preparation</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>"
